  "definition": "Form MS-60W, Audit Waiver Request",
  "effectiveDate": "2024-03-29",
  "historyNote": "#9826, eff 11-25-10; ss by #10582, eff 5-2-14; renumbered by #13078 (formerly Rev 1907.03); ss by #13918, eff 3-29-24 (see Revision Note at chapter heading for Rev 1900)",
